  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S N Consultant vs Deputy Commissioner Of Customs & Anr on 5 November, 2024 Author: Vibhu Bakhru Bench: Vibhu Bakhru, Swarana Kanta Sharma $~10 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 7728/2024 S N Consultant Th ve Deputy Commissioner Of Customs & Anr.... Through: Mr Aditya Singla, S Counsel with Mr Rit Medha Navani, Advoc Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Vibhu Bakhru Hon'Ble Ms. Justice Swarana Kanta Sharma Or % 05.11.2024 1.",
    "facts": "The petitioner has filed the present petition, inter alia, praying as under: \"(a) To direct the respondents to release the goods without bank guarantee (b) To Direct the Respondent no.1 to re-sample the goods covering under Bill of Entry of Entry No 2197904 Dated 19.02.2024 as per the FSSAI Act; (c) Pass such other order or orders as may be deemed fit ad proper in the interest of justice.\" 2. The petitioner is engaged in import and trading of areca nuts and had imported a consignment of the said goods on 12.01.2024. However, the goods were not released pending verification of the certificate of the country of origin. The petitioner being aggrieved on account of non-release of the goods has filed the present petition.",
    "arguments": "5. Mr Aditya Singla, learned counsel, appearing for the respondents submits that an order has been passed and a No Objection Certificate (NOC) for the consignment covered under Bill of Entry No.2197904 dated 19.02.2024 has been granted."
  },
